.TH tale 1  "tale 2.3.2" 
.SH NAME
tale \- A terminal\-native Tailscale workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtale\fR [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-view\fR] [\fB\-\-read\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-local\fR] [\fB\-\-tailscale\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-tailscale\-socket\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal\-native Tailscale workspace
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Select a configured tailnet profile for this session
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read configuration from PATH instead of the default config location
.TP
\fB\-\-view\fR \fI<ROUTE>\fR
Open ROUTE when the terminal interface starts
.TP
\fB\-\-read\-only\fR
Disable every mutation for this session
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-local\fR
Do not connect to the local Tailscale client or daemon
.TP
\fB\-\-tailscale\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Use PATH as the local Tailscale executable
.TP
\fB\-\-tailscale\-socket\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Connect to the local Tailscale daemon at PATH
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tale\-gen\-completions(1)
Print shell completion instructions to standard output
.TP
tale\-auth(1)
Add, inspect, or remove tailnet credentials
.TP
tale\-config(1)
Inspect and validate Tale configuration
.TP
tale\-doctor(1)
Print a redacted, non\-mutating diagnostic report
.SH VERSION
v2.3.2
